    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road Rush is an arcade-like game, where only speed and careful timing will keep you alive. Score as many points as possible by taking risks \u2013 the faster you skate, the more points you\u2019ll get - but watch out for traffic, dogs, pedestrians, and construction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230150/extras/afc4ad7ea96897573448e3febdef9e6d.avif?t=1730387367\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the balance of risk and reward by picking up items for health and points, then share your highest scores on the leaderboard. Use your reflexes to avoid colliding with cars and other obstacles, otherwise it\u2019s Game Over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'80s Nostalgia: Roller skate your way through \u201ctotally tubular\u201d roads and highways. Leap, jet, and chill to avoid the obstacles, or you\u2019re going to be asking yourself, \u201cWhat\u2019s your damage?\u201d Experience the thrill of roller skating on a highway but better steer clear of road blocks - your life depends on it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle Art: 2D characters and bright palettes, all made by hand, 8-Bit inspired visual effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-like: Sounds, sights, and play ability that evokes classic arcade entertainment.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road Rush is an arcade-like game, where only speed and careful timing will keep you alive. Score as many points as possible by taking risks \u2013 the faster you skate, the more points you\u2019ll get - but watch out for traffic, dogs, pedestrians, and construction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230150/extras/afc4ad7ea96897573448e3febdef9e6d.avif?t=1730387367\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the balance of risk and reward by picking up items for health and points, then share your highest scores on the leaderboard. Use your reflexes to avoid colliding with cars and other obstacles, otherwise it\u2019s Game Over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'80s Nostalgia: Roller skate your way through \u201ctotally tubular\u201d roads and highways. Leap, jet, and chill to avoid the obstacles, or you\u2019re going to be asking yourself, \u201cWhat\u2019s your damage?\u201d Experience the thrill of roller skating on a highway but better steer clear of road blocks - your life depends on it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle Art: 2D characters and bright palettes, all made by hand, 8-Bit inspired visual effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-like: Sounds, sights, and play ability that evokes classic arcade entertainment.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "With its easy controls, retro tunes, and familiar scenery, this endless runner arcade game will get your adrenaline flowing. Jump, run, and dodge \u2013 play Road Rush, where every reaction is crucial.",
